  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Planet MPTF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundamental changes in the way we consume and produce are imperative for protecting the planet. The One Planet Multi-Partner Trust Fund supports the necessary shift and offers incentives to national and global leaders to adopt adaptable solutions that overcome challenges to realizing SDG 12 and make good on the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.</narrative>
  </description>
